KBBI data
---------
The following files are derived from Kamus Besar Bahasa Indonesia (KBBI):

  kbbi_words.txt                  headwords used by the offline algorithm
  kbbi_roots.tsv                  derived word -> base word links
  eu_monophthong.json             words whose "eu" KBBI keeps in one syllable
  evaluation/random10000.csv      column kbbi_official (KBBI syllabification)

All KBBI content is owned by Badan Pengembangan dan Pembinaan Bahasa,
Kementerian Pendidikan Dasar dan Menengah, Republik Indonesia. These files
contain headwords, base-word links and syllabifications only, without
definitions, and are included solely for non-commercial research and
education. Any other use must follow the terms of Badan Pengembangan dan
Pembinaan Bahasa. Permission to redistribute them has been requested from
Badan Bahasa and is pending; the files will be removed or restricted if
Badan Bahasa asks.

The web application can also look up individual words in KBBI Daring
(https://kbbi.kemendikdasmen.go.id/) when a user requests them. It fetches
one public entry per word (5-second timeout, 0.15 s between rows of a CSV
batch, at most 100 words per upload) and does not copy the dictionary.

